#### Plan parameters object

The `plan_parameters` object contains the following fields.  All are required unless marked optional.

| Key | Type | Description |
|-----|------|-------------|
| `quantum` | u32 | Clock granularity (base time units). |
| `target_ticks` | u32 | Ticks to reach (e.g., 1140). |
| `mult_num` | u32 | Advance multiplier numerator. |
| `mult_den` | u32 | Advance multiplier denominator. |
| `round_mode` | u8 | Rounding mode: 0=floor, 1=half‑to‑even, 2=ceil, 3=truncate. |
| `hold_cycles` | u8 | Hold cycles after target. |
| `sep_cycles` | u8 | Input‑separation cycles. |
| `reference_block_time` | u32 | Ideal block time (base time units), as supplied at plan‑construction time. |
| `reference_source` | u8 | Provenance of `reference_block_time`: 0=explicit, 1=guessed, 2=calibrated, 3=not applicable. |
| `map_type` | u8 | 0=standard, 1=detrimental. |
| `detrimental_jitter_threshold` | u8 | Threshold for jitter in detrimental mode (0 = default 255). |
| `detrimental_advance_regularity_threshold` | u16 | Threshold for advance regularity in detrimental mode (0 = default 65535). |
| `sparse_map` | boolean | Whether sparse map optimisation was enabled. |
| `scan_resolution_step_freq` | u32 | (optional) Effective step size (10⁻⁵ Hz).  May be omitted; if present, must match the decoded step size from the map header.  The authoritative step size is always in the map header. |
| `jitter_weight` | u8 (1‑255) | Resolved effective weight for jitter (never 0). |
| `advance_regularity_weight` | u8 (1‑255) | Resolved effective weight for advance regularity (never 0). |
| `advance_regularity_full_precision` | integer | (optional) Full‑precision average of per‑jitter‑point advance regularity (ticks × 100), before saturation.  Enables exact score reconstruction. |
| `score` | integer | (optional) Candidate score (Phase 1), saturated to `UINT64_MAX`.  Stored as JSON number; precision loss above 2⁵³−1.  Use `advance_regularity_full_precision` for exact comparisons. |
| `jitter_window_radius` | u8 (0‑255) | Scale factor; 0 = default radius 10000.  Effective radius = value × 1000. |
| `long_term_scan` | boolean | Whether long‑term scan was active. |
| `environment_snapshot_hash` | string | (Optional) XXH3‑128 hex fingerprint of the Environment Snapshot bound to the plan, if any. |

*(The library shorthands for `jitter_weight` and `advance_regularity_weight` are resolved to their actual defaults (4 and 1) at plan‑construction time; the shorthand values are **never** recorded here. The `.gunzmeta` schema is not modified; the presence of non‑zero `advance_regularity_full` in the first record of a `.gunzstats` file is sufficient to signal that the field is recorded.  If an implementation prefers an explicit flag, a boolean `stats_include_full_advance_regularity` may be added to the `plan_parameters` object, but this is not required.*)

