## 5. GUNZ‑NET (Future)

GUNZ‑NET is a planned companion specification for automated map exchange, deduplication, and network‑scale coordination. It is not part of the GUNZ 3.80.0 core standard. In the meantime, `.gunzmap` files carry their own integrity proofs and can be shared directly.

**Versioning policy:** Any future `GUNZ‑NET` revision shall preserve backward compatibility of the existing fields; new fields will be added only in a reserved extension space.

